  "_curation_note": "PQSigner semantic curation: all three sUSDe cooldown routes are admitted only for the fixed Ethereum StakedUSDeV2 deployment below. cooldownShares shows the exact sUSDe burned and states that queued USDe is calculated at the live ERC-4626 rate. cooldownAssets shows the exact USDe queued and states that burned sUSDe is calculated at the live rate. unstake shows the exact receiver and states that the full payout comes from the caller's cooldown state. Evidence pins the direct runtime, Blockscout/Sourcify-verified source and ABI, USDe asset, immutable silo, token metadata, zero standard proxy slots, and fixed-block cooldown duration. It is historical authority, not live conversion rate, cooldown balance/readiness, pause/access state, execution success, future code changes, fallback, or blind-signing authority.",
